{"text": "Just then. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Jim came skipping. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Out of the gate. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With a tin bucket. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was going to bring water. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> From the town pump. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Jim, I will get the water. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If you whitewash some. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Tom. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But Jim shook his head. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And ran away. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Afraid of Aunt Polly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Tom began to think of all the fun. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He had planned for this day. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soon the free boys. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Would come by and laugh at him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For having to work. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He looked in his pockets. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But he had only. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Some toys and pieces of junk. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was not enough. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To buy even half an hour. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Of freedom. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At this dark and hopeless moment. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A great idea. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Burst upon him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was nothing less than a great, magnificent idea. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He took up his brush. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And went quietly to work.", "alignment": {"characters": ["J", "u", "s", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "J", "i", "m", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "s", "k", "i", "p", "p", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "O", "u", "t", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "a", "t", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "i", "t", "h", " ", "a", " ", "t", "i", "n", "